# Keep LF everywhere so the SHA-256 hashes of the pre-registrations and frozen configs
# match on every machine (Windows autocrlf would otherwise change the bytes).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
# Frozen configs are hashed byte-for-byte in the pre-registrations: store them exactly as written.
results/**/chosen_config.json -text
results/chosen_config.json -text
